    "standardized_narrative": "At 31 December 2022 the syndicate's opening gross claims outstanding (at 1 Jan 2022) was 1,096.5 (USD millions). The syndicate reported a net prior year release of $9.3m in 2022 driven by favourable claims development and reductions in IBNR margins, principally from MAP Risks and Property Risks, partially offset by adverse strengthening in Cyber (notably on the 2020 underwriting year). Several named catastrophe and geopolitical events (Hurricane Ian, Ida, Laura, Storm Uri, Storm Elliott and the war in Ukraine) have influenced recent years but the documented prior year movement disclosed is a modest net release.",
    "raw_causal_phrases": [
      "During 2022 the syndicate released prior year reserves of $9.3m (2021: $33.1m).",
      "The syndicate experienced a large net release on the MAP Risks and Property Risks divisions, offset by a strengthening on the Cyber Risks division on the 2020 underwriting year.",
      "The syndicate has a consistent reserving philosophy, with initial reserves being set to include risk margins that may be released over time as and when any uncertainty reduces.",
      "The margin held above the actuarial estimate for the syndicate was 4.7% at the end of 2022 (2021: 5.2%)."
